<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gensec half yr shr doubles, no div.</title>
<headline>Gensec half yr shr doubles, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     102	   vs 53</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   115	   vs 57</p>
<p>    Expenses		  116	   vs 83</p>
<p>    Revenue		   233	   vs 140</p>
<p>Full name: Genbel Securities Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said that no dividend had been declared as it was the firm's policy to consider payments on an annual basis.</p>
<p>They said Gensec should be able to repeat its first half performance in the second half of the year provided there was no marked deterioration in the South Afican investment market.</p>
<p>They said an application for a banking licence was being prepared and was expected to be lodged shortly.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
